->> Everytime we use tailwind CSS we have to download it in every project with the below 
command

npm install tailwindcss @tailwindcss/vite

->> also you have to add this in vite.config.js :
   export default defineConfig({
  plugins: 
  [
    react(), 
    tailwindcss(),
  ],
})


->> in index.CSS add :
        @import "tailwindcss";


->> in main.jsx add :
   import './index.css'